msgid "F407 DCMI 与 I2S2／3"
msgstr "F407 DCMI and I2S2/3"

msgid "这里记录 `capture.c`、`audio.c` 和同源静态装配的合同。芯片 AF 路线来自 DS8626 Rev12；寄存器、DMA 与关闭时序来自 RM0090 Rev22。软件参考限定 STM32F407VE／ZG，不代表摄像头、codec、PCB 接线、电气时序或物理 HIL 已执行。"
msgstr "This page records the contracts of `capture.c`, `audio.c` and their shared static assembly. Silicon AF routes come from DS8626 Rev12; register, DMA and stop ordering come from RM0090 Rev22. Software references target STM32F407VE/ZG and do not establish camera, codec, PCB wiring, electrical timing or physical HIL execution."

msgid "静态配置、资源责任与公共调用边界见下图。"
msgstr "The following diagram shows static configuration, resource responsibility and public call boundaries."

msgid "![F4 源码归属与接口边界](../../../docs/assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"
msgstr "![F4 source ownership and interface boundaries](../../../docs/assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"

msgid "F4 源码归属与接口边界"
msgstr "F4 source ownership and interface boundaries"

msgid "图表示当前源码和依赖关系；具体模式、关闭证明和时间域规则以下文为准。"
msgstr "The diagram shows current source and dependency relationships. The sections below define exact modes, shutdown proof and time-domain rules."

msgid "箭头表示当前配置、调用与所有权关系，不表示吞吐保证。factory 只返回已有 `nx_capture_t` 或 `nx_audio_t`。Platform prepare 取得资源并配置格式，不启动 CAPTURE、I2SE 或一次 DMA 传输；应用通过公共 face 提交请求或启动 RAW blocks。 Platform close 调用同一个 C owner 排空，失败会阻止 System 退出，保留全部借用和 精确清理责任。没有 heap、运行时名字注册表、默认 buffer pool 或后台任务。"
msgstr "Arrows describe current configuration, call and ownership relationships, not throughput guarantees. Factory lookup returns an existing `nx_capture_t` or `nx_audio_t`. Platform prepare acquires resources and configures the format without starting CAPTURE, I2SE or DMA. Applications submit requests or start RAW blocks through public faces. Platform close uses that same C owner to drain. Failure prevents System withdrawal and retains every borrow and exact cleanup responsibility. There is no heap, runtime name registry, default buffer pool or background task."

msgid "DCMI 输入与模式"
msgstr "DCMI inputs and modes"

msgid "`capture` 有 `snapshot-raw`、`snapshot-jpeg` 和 `raw-blocks` 三种装配模式。 8-bit RAW 每四个输入样本存入一个 32-bit DMA word；10／12／14-bit RAW 的每个样本 占一个 16-bit 容器，有效数据在低位，不是紧密位打包。VE 最多选择 12-bit；14-bit 需要 ZG 的 PF11／PG15。所有路线 AF13，D0–D7 为 PC6／PC7／PC8／PC9／PC11／PB6／PB8／PB9，D8–D11 为 PC10／PC12／PB5／PD2，PCLK 为 PA6。hardware sync 另取 PA4 HSYNC、PB7 VSYNC； 8-bit embedded sync 不取得这两根 pad 或未用高位 pad。"
msgstr "`capture` selects `snapshot-raw`, `snapshot-jpeg` or `raw-blocks`. Four 8-bit RAW input samples occupy one 32-bit DMA word. Each 10/12/14-bit RAW sample occupies a 16-bit container with significant bits low, rather than packed bit storage. VE supports up to12 bits; 14 bits requires PF11/PG15 on ZG. All routes use AF13. D0–D7 are PC6/PC7/PC8/PC9/PC11/PB6/PB8/PB9; D8–D11 are PC10/PC12/PB5/PD2; PCLK is PA6. Hardware sync also acquires PA4 HSYNC and PB7 VSYNC. Eight-bit embedded sync acquires neither those sync pads nor unused upper data pads."

msgid "embedded 必须显式给出 frame-start、line-start、line-end、frame-end 四个 byte code。官方 `HAL_DCMI_Init` 的 READY 状态只绕过 MSP，仍启用 LINE／VSYNC／ERR／OVR； owner 先持有责任，再掩蔽并回读 IER。官方 Init 不写 ESUR，因此这里显式写入并观察 四个 `0xff` unmask。栈上 Handle 的 State／Lock 明确初始化，热态 IRQ 和 DMA 不引用该 Handle。crop 参数直接表示输入 clock／line 计数，按寄存器存储，不额外 减一，也不把它们解释成输出像素长宽。JPEG 不允许 crop 或 embedded sync。"
msgstr "Embedded sync explicitly declares frame-start, line-start, line-end and frame-end byte codes. Official `HAL_DCMI_Init` in READY state skips MSP only and still enables LINE/VSYNC/ERR/OVR. The owner records responsibility first, then masks and reads back IER. Official Init does not write ESUR, so the provider explicitly installs and observes four `0xff` unmask bytes. The stack Handle has explicitly initialized State/Lock; hot IRQ/DMA paths do not reference it. Crop parameters directly describe input clock/line counts stored in registers. They are neither decremented nor interpreted as output pixel dimensions. JPEG rejects crop and embedded sync."

msgid "`pixel_clock_hz` 是调用者声明的实际输入上界，必须同时满足 54 MHz 电气上限及 PIXCLK/HCLK≤0.4。它用于软件观测预算，不是总线持续吞吐资格；sensor、DMA 仲裁及 并发负载仍需物理验证。DMA2 只取得 stream1 或 stream7、channel1；选择冲突会在 同一资源图中拒绝，包括 stream1 与 ADC3 默认 DMA 路线的冲突。ES0182 Rev19 §2.2.19 列出的受影响访问为 QUADSPI indirect、带 FIFO 的 FSMC 外设读写，以及 DMA2 memory-to-peripheral 写 GPIO。该条没有声明 DCMI＋ADC 通用禁用；这里的 DCMI P2M peripheral port→SRAM memory port 没有选择上述外部 FIFO／GPIO 写路径。 这不证明全部 DMA 并发吞吐或丢帧边界，实际负载仍需 HIL 验证。"
msgstr "`pixel_clock_hz` is the caller-declared actual input upper bound and must satisfy both the 54 MHz electrical limit and PIXCLK/HCLK≤0.4. It supports software observation budgeting, not sustained bus-throughput qualification. Sensors, DMA arbitration and concurrent loads still need hardware validation. DMA2 uses stream1 or stream7 channel1; the common resource graph rejects conflicts, including stream1 versus the default ADC3 DMA route. ES0182 Rev19 §2.2.19 lists QUADSPI indirect accesses, FSMC peripheral reads/writes with FIFOs and DMA2 memory-to-peripheral GPIO writes. It does not declare a general DCMI+ADC prohibition. This DCMI P2M peripheral-port-to-SRAM-memory-port path selects none of those external-FIFO/GPIO-write paths. This does not qualify all concurrent DMA throughput or frame-loss bounds; actual loads still need HIL."

msgid "Snapshot 与 JPEG 前缀"
msgstr "Snapshot and JPEG prefixes"

msgid "调用者初始化 stream 和 request。RAW 还将同一个 stream 绑定到一份完整、连续的 `nx_frame_stream_t`，请求 `storage_bytes` 与该布局精确相等。RAW 要求 FRAME、 完整存储计数、CAPTURE 退出、DCMI FIFO 空、DMA 总线停止、两个 IRQ 实际排空及地址 解绑全部成立，才发布完整 frame。空 crop 也可能产生 FRAME，因此单有 FRAME 不代表完整 RAW 图像。"
msgstr "The caller initializes stream and request. RAW additionally binds that same stream to a complete contiguous `nx_frame_stream_t`; request `storage_bytes` must equal its layout exactly. A complete RAW frame requires FRAME, complete storage count, CAPTURE withdrawal, empty DCMI FIFO, stopped DMA bus, actual drain of both IRQs and detached addresses. An empty crop can also produce FRAME; FRAME alone does not prove a complete RAW image."

msgid "JPEG 使用普通 stream，`raw_frame=NULL`。正常短图不会触发 DMA TC：FRAME 到达后 等待 CAPTURE 退出和 DCMI FIFO 排空，再停止 DMA，观察稳定 NDTR。返回的 `base.transferred` 和 block length 是已存储的 32-bit word 前缀，包含最后一字中的 硬件补零，绝不等于 JPEG 有效 codestream 字节数。应用自行解析 SOI／EOI／长度。 RAW 和 JPEG 每次 snapshot 的存储上界为 65535 个 DMA words，且须完整位于已审 DMA 可达域；CCM 被排除。大图可用 RAW storage blocks，但这些块没有图像边界保证。"
msgstr "JPEG uses an ordinary stream with `raw_frame=NULL`. A normal short image does not produce DMA TC. After FRAME, the provider waits for CAPTURE withdrawal and FIFO drain, stops DMA and observes stable NDTR. `base.transferred` and block length describe the stored 32-bit-word prefix, including hardware zero padding in its final word, not valid JPEG codestream bytes. The application parses SOI/EOI/length itself. RAW/JPEG snapshots allow at most65535 DMA words wholly inside reviewed DMA-reachable memory, excluding CCM. Large images can use RAW storage blocks, which provide no image-boundary guarantee."

msgid "snapshot 硬件忽略 FCRC，因此 snapshot 的 `frame_divisor` 只能为 1。连续 RAW 可 选择 1／2／4，表示输入帧筛选，而非准确输出 N 帧。没有按可合并 FRAME bit 与 NDTR 推导精确帧数的接口。"
msgstr "Snapshot hardware ignores FCRC, so snapshot `frame_divisor` must be1. Continuous RAW permits1/2/4 for input-frame selection, not an exact output-frame count. No interface infers exact frame counts from coalescible FRAME bits and NDTR."

msgid "连续 RAW storage blocks"
msgstr "Continuous RAW storage blocks"

msgid "应用给出至少三个等容量、四字节对齐的 stream slots 和明确 `max_service_gap_us`。owner 用已有 posted producer 借用两个 DMA targets，并在每个 可信 TC 后取得 replacement、更新非活动 target、再次观察 CT／TC，然后 FIFO 发布脱离硬件的旧 target。块是连续 RAW 存储片段，不是完整图像或精确帧数。"
msgstr "The application supplies at least three equal-capacity four-byte-aligned stream slots and explicit `max_service_gap_us`. The owner uses the existing posted producer to borrow two DMA targets. After each trustworthy TC it acquires a replacement, updates the inactive target, reobserves CT/TC and publishes the detached old target in FIFO order. Blocks are contiguous RAW storage fragments, not complete images or exact frame counts."

msgid "双缓冲 CT 只能观察当前 bank，不能恢复丢失的两次或三次翻转。这里按 PIXCLK 上界、 8／16-bit 存储宽度和 FIFO 余量检查 block 容量；两次显式 service 的间隔必须在预算内。 超预算、CT 歧义、替换期间 bank 切换或没有 replacement 时停止并报告 LOSS，不能 覆盖 READY／BORROWED。LOSS 只表示确实观察到一次无法继续的边界，不虚构错过的帧数。 IRQ 只锁存事实，应用必须主动 service，不创建隐式 worker。"
msgstr "Double-buffer CT shows the current bank only and cannot reconstruct two or three missed toggles. Block capacity is checked against the PIXCLK bound, 8/16-bit storage width and FIFO margin. Consecutive explicit service calls must stay within budget. An exceeded budget, ambiguous CT, a bank switch during replacement or no replacement stops capture and reports LOSS without overwriting READY/BORROWED storage. LOSS records an observed inability to continue and never invents missed frame counts. IRQs latch facts only; the application drives service without a hidden worker."

msgid "取消及关闭可能等待 sensor 帧尾后才看到 CAPTURE 清除；sensor 停钟会使退出失败。 失败保留 request、stream、两个 targets 以及已经取得的第三个 replacement。 显式 `recover` 先观察 DMA 禁用和 IRQ 排空，再只复位独占的 DCMI；绝不 reset 共享 DMA2。丢失 clock／reset／System epoch 历史的借用不能靠恢复成 reset 外观来撤销。"
msgstr "Cancellation/close may wait until a sensor frame ends before CAPTURE clears; a stopped sensor clock can prevent withdrawal. Failure retains request, stream, both targets and an already-acquired third replacement. Explicit `recover` first observes DMA disabled and IRQs drained, then resets only the exclusive DCMI, never shared DMA2. Restoring a reset-like register appearance cannot revoke borrowing after lost clock/reset/System-epoch history."

msgid "I2S2／3 格式、时钟与有限 DMA"
msgstr "I2S2/3 formats, clocks and finite DMA"

msgid "`audio` 选择 master／slave 与 tx／rx／duplex 六种模式，支持 Philips、MSB justified、 LSB justified、PCM short／long，16／24／32-bit data，16 或 32-bit wire slots。 16-bit data 在 32-bit slot 的低 16 位由硬件补零，内存仍只用一个 halfword；24／32-bit 每个样本用两个 halfwords，内存按 HIGH halfword、LOW halfword 的 DMA 顺序存储， 不是 native little-endian uint32 PCM。I2S／justified frame 含两个 channel slots； PCM frame 是一个单通道同步周期。owner 不转换数据、复制音频或选择 codec。"
msgstr "`audio` selects six master/slave × tx/rx/duplex modes, supporting Philips, MSB justified, LSB justified, PCM short/long, 16/24/32-bit data and 16- or32-bit wire slots. Hardware pads the low16 bits of 16-bit data in a32-bit slot; memory still uses one halfword. A24/32-bit sample occupies two halfwords in DMA order HIGH then LOW, not native little-endian uint32 PCM. I2S/justified frames contain two channel slots; a PCM frame is one mono synchronization period. The owner neither converts/copies audio nor selects a codec."

msgid "I2S2 用 PB12 WS／PB13 CK／PB15 SD AF5，extension RX 用 PB14 AF6，MCLK 用 PC6 AF5。 I2S3 用 PA15 WS／PC10 CK／PC12 SD AF6，extension RX 用 PC11 AF5，MCLK 用 PC7 AF6。 不选择 extension 或 MCLK 时不取得对应 pad。主接收、主发送及 slave simplex 分别 使用其精确 DMA request；duplex 由主单元 TX 配合 extension RX 共享 CK／WS。普通 SPI2／3 personality、pad 或 DMA 路线冲突在配置期拒绝。"
msgstr "I2S2 uses PB12 WS/PB13 CK/PB15 SD AF5, extension RX on PB14 AF6 and MCLK on PC6 AF5. I2S3 uses PA15 WS/PC10 CK/PC12 SD AF6, extension RX on PC11 AF5 and MCLK on PC7 AF6. Unselected extension/MCLK pads are not acquired. Master RX, master TX and slave simplex use their exact DMA requests; duplex uses main-unit TX plus extension RX with shared CK/WS. Configuration rejects ordinary SPI2/3 personality, pad and DMA-route conflicts."

msgid "master 显式选择 PLLI2S N／R、目标采样率和最大名义分频 ppm 误差。PLLI2S 复用 System 的 source／M；生成器计算精确有理数名义 rate 和 I2SDIV／ODD，不把分频误差当作振荡器物理精度。 两个音频 owner 共享同一个兼容 PLLI2S lease；最后一个关闭者才撤回新增 PLLI2S， 不会修改主 PLL 或共享 DMA1。slave 不取得 PLLI2S、不生成 MCLK，rate 查询返回 0/0 unknown，不虚构外部 master 采样率。"
msgstr "Master mode explicitly selects PLLI2S N/R, target sampling rate and maximum nominal divider error in ppm. PLLI2S shares System source/M. The generator computes exact rational nominal rate and I2SDIV/ODD; divider error is not physical oscillator accuracy. Two audio owners share one compatible PLLI2S lease; the last close withdraws only newly added PLLI2S without changing the main PLL or shared DMA1. Slave mode acquires no PLLI2S, generates no MCLK and reports rate0/0 unknown rather than inventing the external master rate."

msgid "TX 接受现有 `nx_frame_dma_loan_t`，RX 从调用者的 framed stream 借用一个 fill； duplex 要求两个方向等长完整块。DMA 以 halfword 为单位，每方向最多 65535 个。 外部 slave 时序由应用协调：准备时 CK 保持所选 idle level，WS 在 Philips 为 HIGH、 其他标准为 LOW。只有 acquire-observed ACTIVE 才启动外部 clock。slave TX 的 ACTIVE 需要真实 DR prefill、精确 NDTR=N−1、TXE=0、使能后至少三个实际微秒 tick 及 三个外设 clock，并再次确认 CK／WS 仍保持 idle。"
msgstr "TX accepts an existing `nx_frame_dma_loan_t`; RX borrows a fill from the caller framed stream. Duplex requires equal-length complete blocks. DMA counts halfwords, at most65535 per direction. The application coordinates external slave timing: CK stays at the selected idle level during preparation; WS is HIGH for Philips and LOW for other standards. External clocks start only after acquire-observed ACTIVE. Slave TX requires actual DR prefill, exact NDTR=N−1, TXE=0, at least three actual microsecond ticks and three peripheral clocks after enable, then a repeated CK/WS idle check before ACTIVE."

msgid "TX 关闭观察 DMA EN0、TXE1、随后新读到 BSY0，再撤销 I2SE。主 RX 的 BSY 始终为0， 因此采用 RM0090 专用序列：按格式在 n−1 或最后一个 DMA halfword 后，用保留原值的 DWT CYCCNT 观察 1 CK（16-bit extended LSB 为17 CK），撤销 I2SE，必要时从 DR 取 最后一个 CPU halfword。迟到的 RXNE／OVR 不能变成成功证明。DWT 的新增使能位也有 共享收条，最后关闭时恢复。有限主 RX 至少需要两个存储 halfwords。实际 IRQ 延迟、clock 波形与关闭窗口仍需物理 HIL 验证。"
msgstr "TX shutdown observes DMA EN0, TXE1, then a fresh BSY0 before withdrawing I2SE. Master RX always has BSY0 and uses the RM0090-specific sequence: after n−1 or the final DMA halfword according to format, retained DWT CYCCNT observes1 CK (17 CK for16-bit extended LSB), I2SE is withdrawn and a final CPU halfword is read from DR when needed. Late RXNE/OVR cannot establish success. Newly enabled DWT bits also have shared receipts restored at final close. Finite master RX requires at least two storage halfwords. Actual IRQ latency, clocks and shutdown windows still require physical HIL."

msgid "错误／取消报告零个有效音频字节。DMA TC、NDTR0、timeout 或停止 clock 都不直接 归还借用；Serializer／DMA／IRQ／地址全部排空后才归还 TX 或发布 RX。任何失败 保留完整 request 和未归还 loans，close 不允许 System 提前退出。所有 deadline 包含最终排空，重新建立 System epoch 后的旧借用保持 quarantine。"
msgstr "Error/cancellation reports zero valid audio bytes. DMA TC, NDTR0, timeout or stopping clocks never directly returns a borrow. TX is returned or RX published only after serializer/DMA/IRQ/address drain. Failure retains the complete request and outstanding loans and prevents premature System close. Deadlines include final drain. Outstanding borrows from the previous System epoch remain quarantined after a new epoch is established."

msgid "装配与验证入口"
msgstr "Assembly and validation"

msgid "`tests/contracts/f407_capture_audio/` 是外部 software-only Board 夹具，覆盖 VE RAW12 配 I2S2 duplex、ZG embedded RAW blocks 配 I2S3、ZG RAW14、JPEG 以及 I2S3 MCLK。 它们不修改公共 Board 的接线事实。`tools/configure/test_f407_capture_audio_configuration.py` 检查严格字段、typed IR、真实 claims、pure factory 及固定生命周期连接。 `tests/google/f407_capture_audio_test.cpp` 编译真实 C11 owner 和官方 DCMI cold Init， 只替换 CPU／MMIO 边界；失败 drain、迟到 IRQ、CT 歧义、欠替代 buffer、原始借用及 多实例共享时钟均在同一个完整程序中执行。模型结果、ARM ELF 和 HIL 分别验收； 本软件工作不执行 HIL。"
msgstr "`tests/contracts/f407_capture_audio/` provides external software-only Board fixtures: VE RAW12 with I2S2 duplex, ZG embedded RAW blocks with I2S3, ZG RAW14, JPEG and I2S3 MCLK. They do not change public Board wiring facts. `tools/configure/test_f407_capture_audio_configuration.py` checks strict fields, typed IR, actual claims, pure factories and fixed lifecycle connections. `tests/google/f407_capture_audio_test.cpp` compiles actual C11 owners and official DCMI cold Init, replacing only CPU/MMIO boundaries. One complete program covers failed drains, late IRQs, ambiguous CT, unavailable replacements, original borrows and multi-instance shared clocks. Models, ARM ELFs and HIL are separately accepted; this software work executes no HIL."

msgid "旧 I2S2 专用角色迁移"
msgstr "Retiring the dedicated I2S2 role"

msgid "`sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` 和 `qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` 保留参考输入名称，改用 随 SDK 交付的 `f407-audio-reference/ve`、`zg` 软件 Board，不声明 Sky 或启明实板 音频接线。标准 `[audio.sound]` 与 factory／Platform 已覆盖原 Philips stereo16 引脚、DMA 和完整借用职责；旧 `[i2s2]`、组件、手动 owner 初始化及专用 driver 已删除。"
msgstr "`sky-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` and `qiming-i2s2-slave-tx.toml` retain their reference filenames but use shipped `f407-audio-reference/ve` and `zg` software Boards without claiming Sky or Qiming physical audio wiring. Standard `[audio.sound]`, factory and Platform cover the original Philips stereo16 pads, DMA and complete borrowing duties. Legacy `[i2s2]`, its component, manual owner initialization and dedicated driver are removed."

msgid "旧程序中仍有效的回归转入同一个 capture/audio 程序："
msgstr "Still-valid regressions from the old program move into the same capture/audio program:"

msgid "原职责"
msgstr "Original duty"

msgid "保留的独立行为验证"
msgstr "Retained independent behavior checks"

msgid "prefill、冻结时钟、WS 丢失"
msgstr "Prefill, frozen clocks and lost WS"

msgid "真实三微秒 tick、DR/NDTR/TXE、保持 idle 后才 ACTIVE"
msgstr "Actual three-microsecond ticks, DR/NDTR/TXE, and idle preserved before ACTIVE"

msgid "TC／NDTR 不能归还借用"
msgstr "TC/NDTR cannot release a borrow"

msgid "新读 TXE 后再读 BSY，取消／deadline／停止失败保留 loan"
msgstr "Fresh TXE before BSY; cancellation/deadline/stop failures retain the loan"

msgid "DMA／IRQ／地址退出失败"
msgstr "Failed DMA/IRQ/address withdrawal"

msgid "duplex 和 TX 的完整借用、停止重试及已取得的线上排空证明"
msgstr "Complete duplex/TX borrows, stop retries and already-obtained wire-drain proof"

msgid "几何、DMA 权限、计数上限"
msgstr "Geometry, DMA permissions and count limits"

msgid "非空防溢出整块 rows、禁止 padding、131068B stereo16 上界"
msgstr "Nonempty nonwrapping complete rows, no padding, 131068B stereo16 bound"

msgid "伪造及别名控制"
msgstr "Forged and aliased controls"

msgid "copied／stale／未对齐 loan、request 落在未用 payload capacity 尾部"
msgstr "Copied/stale/misaligned loans and a request placed in unused payload-capacity tail"

msgid "read-clear 与历史丢失"
msgstr "Read-clear and lost history"

msgid "首次 SR 故障、reset／DMA gate／时基／epoch 丢失后永久 quarantine"
msgstr "Initial SR faults and permanent quarantine after reset/DMA-gate/timebase/epoch loss"

msgid "SETTLED 最后访问"
msgstr "SETTLED as final access"

msgid "provider 清除所有 payload 引用，控制块 PROT_NONE 后迟到 IRQ 和 close"
msgstr "All payload references detached before late IRQ/close with control storage set PROT_NONE"

msgid "执行上下文及共享状态"
msgstr "Execution context and shared state"

msgid "privilege／ISR／三个 incoming masks、共享 PLL、邻 DMA、IRQ 原优先级"
msgstr "Privilege/ISR/three incoming masks, shared PLL, neighboring DMA and original IRQ priorities"

msgid "原手动 face／storage ABI 的布局检查随该 ABI 退出。原 System 特殊 gate 分支的三项 测试只证明手动调用者已自行 join 的前提，随该架构删除；标准 Platform 现在实际调用 audio close，无法完成借用排空就拒绝资源撤回。cold 状态及共享 GPIO／DMA 门由已有 Platform 资源 owner 统一取得，factory 不再允许调用者构造第二个硬件 owner。 linked provider 验证沿用普通 generated face→五方法表→真实私有函数的同一机制， 无需专用角色、公共 opaque storage 或另一个硬件发现入口。"
msgstr "Layout checks of the manual face/storage ABI retire with that ABI. Three tests of special System gates proved only that manual callers had joined their users and retire with that architecture. Standard Platform now actually calls audio close and refuses resource withdrawal without complete borrow drain. Existing Platform resource owners acquire cold state and shared GPIO/DMA gates. Factory no longer lets callers construct a second hardware owner. Linked-provider verification uses the same generated-face→five-method-table→actual-private-function mechanism without a dedicated role, public opaque storage or another discovery entry point."
